B.bi2=s(["Kreyasyon ak chanjman aks\xe8 p\xe8son\xe8l mande ent\xe8n\xe8t.","La cr\xe9ation et les changements d\u2019acc\xe8s du personnel n\xe9cessitent Internet.","Staff creation and access changes require Internet."],t.s)
